  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components and autoclave. After cooling, add the following solutions (autoclaved or filter--sterilized) to the medium:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Distribute the culture medium into culture tubes (leave >80% volume as a gas phase) andseal with butyl rubber stoppers."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Finally, replace the gas phase with 20% methane and 5% CO2 in air (by volume)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "Mix 28 ml of 1 M KH2PO4 and 78 ml of 1 M Na2HPO4 to prepare 100 ml of 1 M phosphate buffer."
    }
  ]
}